{"s":"name2"},{"s":"congrats"}]},"codeShots":true,"why":"A flatbed truck stands on the driveway in front of the garage, seen from the side with its chassis open, so the wheels, the rear steering motor, the tie rod and the spring all show. With front steering only, the tail swings out and knocks over a post. Rear steering turns the truck tightly, then in-phase at speed, then adds a failsafe spring. The camera starts on the truck, moves to the tail and rear axle for the fixes, and ends on the truck crabbing into the garage.","hold":true,"beats":[{"s":"hook","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"front wheels turn"},"do":[{"p":"giant","v":"show"},{"p":"giant","v":"frontTurn","w":"steer"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"tail swings out toward the post"},"state":{"text":"TAIL SWINGS","w":"swings"},"do":[{"p":"bollard","v":"show","w":"But"},{"p":"giant","v":"yaw","w":"tail"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant","bollard"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"stakes","shows":{"p":"bollard","does":"post falls over"},"state":{"text":"CRUNCH!","w":"clips"},"do":[{"p":"bollard","v":"fall","w":"clips"}],"shots":[{"focus":["bollard","giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix1","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"rear motor and rod appear"},"do":[{"p":"bollard","v":"fallBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"yawBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"motorOn","w":"motor"},{"p":"giant","v":"rodOn","w":"axle"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"name","shows":{"p":"carOutline","does":"outline traces the truck"},"do":[{"p":"carOutline","v":"show","w":"This","o":0.3}],"shots":[{"hero":true,"focus":["giant","carOutline"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"how","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"rear wheels turn against the front and the truck pivots tight"},"do":[{"p":"carOutline","v":"hide","w":"crawl"},{"p":"giant","v":"run","w":"motor"},{"p":"giant","v":"rodSlide","w":"motor","o":0.2},{"p":"giant","v":"rearTurn","w":"rear"},{"p":"giant","v":"tight","w":"pivots"},{"p":"giant","v":"tuck","w":"pivots"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fact","shows":{"p":"angle","does":"counter ticks up to 10 degrees"},"do":[{"p":"standA","v":"show","w":"Mercedes"},{"p":"angle","v":"show","w":"Mercedes"},{"p":"angle","v":"count","w":"turns","d":1.8}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant","angle"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"tail whips around while the speed climbs"},"state":{"text":"TAIL WHIPS","w":"whip"},"do":[{"p":"angle","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"standS","v":"show","w":"But"},{"p":"speed","v":"show","w":"But"},{"p":"speed","v":"count","w":"But","d":2.4},{"p":"giant","v":"tightBack","w":"But"},{"p":"giant","v":"tuckBack","w":"But"},{"p":"giant","v":"whip","w":"whip"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant","speed"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix2","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"rear wheels turn the same way and the truck straightens"},"do":[{"p":"giant","v":"whipBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"rearTurnBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"rearSame","w":"same"},{"p":"speed","v":"hide","w":"tracks"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"name2","shows":{"p":"rearOutline","does":"outline traces the rear wheels"},"do":[{"p":"rearOutline","v":"show","w":"called"}],"shots":[{"hero":true,"focus":["giant","rearOutline"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"rod snaps and the truck veers"},"state":{"text":"STUCK","w":"stuck"},"do":[{"p":"rearOutline","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"giant","v":"runBack","w":"fails"},{"p":"giant","v":"break","w":"snap"},{"p":"giant","v":"veer","w":"veers"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix3","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"spring appears and centers the rear wheels"},"do":[{"p":"giant","v":"veerBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"breakBack","w":"So"},{"p":"giant","v":"springOn","w":"spring"},{"p":"giant","v":"rearSameBack","w":"center"}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"giant","does":"truck crabs into the garage under a ceiling light"},"do":[{"p":"giant","v":"frontTurnBack"},{"p":"giant","v":"drive"},{"p":"giant","v":"driveBack"},{"p":"garageLight","v":"show","w":"light"},{"p":"giant","v":"frontTurn","w":"crab"},{"p":"giant","v":"rearSame","w":"crab"},{"p":"giant","v":"park","w":"crab","o":-0.7,"d":3}],"shots":[{"focus":["giant","garageLight"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"roles":["hook","problem","stakes","fix1","name","how","fact","problem2","fix2","name2","problem3","fix3","finish","congrats"]},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you only steer the front wheels of a long truck, you have a truck that cannot turn tight."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the long body cannot pivot, so its tail swings out wide toward a post."},{"role":"stakes","text":"The swinging tail clips the post and knocks it flat, which in a tight street means a crunched bumper."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you bolt a steering motor onto the rear axle, so the back wheels can turn too."},{"role":"name","text":"This is four-wheel steering."},{"role":"how","text":"At a crawl, the motor turns the rear wheels against the front ones, so the truck pivots in a tight circle like a compact."},{"role":"fact","text":"A Mercedes S-Class turns its rear wheels up to 10 degrees, which cuts its turning circle by up to about 2 meters."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But at highway speed, turning the rear wheels against the front makes the tail whip around."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So above about 37 miles per hour the rear wheels turn the same way as the front, and the truck tracks straight."},{"role":"name2","text":"Turning the same way is called in-phase steering, and the tight low-speed turn is called counter-phase."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But if the motor fails, the rod can snap and leave the rear wheels stuck, so the truck veers."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you add a spring that pulls the rear wheels back to center and holds them straight."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a ceiling light and let the truck crab sideways into the garage."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a truck that parks like a compact car."}]}